-- `game/core/app.gd`: swiping left advances Race -> Create -> Garage; right reverses, with no wrapping. Create means the biome/draft menus. Reopening creation choices preserves the current document. The editor canvas retains its existing pan/edit gestures. Menu changes between these tabs use a 280 ms horizontal cubic ease-out. The logo, tabs, account and Settings stay fixed; both outgoing and incoming content/scenery slide in a viewport clipped below the header. Full-screen scenic framing is retained inside that clip. Outgoing content ignores GUI input and stops processing; swipe completion parks it as an inactive reverse neighbor; leaving the tab group and starting a race clean up transitions. A new press settles an earlier animation before hit-testing, allowing rapid consecutive swipes while retaining carousel ownership. The existing track-selection slide is independent. Same-tab refreshes are immediate.
